          "The first question in foreign vendor W-8BEN review is not how fast the queue moves but whether the evidence can support the decision. Accounts Payable Manager gives the accounts payable specialist a defined intake step and gives the controller a defined review point. Everything between those two points should leave a dated trace. When the trace is missing, the case is not ready for a decision even if the status field says otherwise."
