          "A useful foreign vendor W-8BEN review record answers four questions. Who opened the case, what source was checked, which field changed, and who approved the close. Those answers belong together in the foreign vendor W-8BEN review file, not in a separate email thread. A reviewer should be able to follow the path in under a minute."
