          "When foreign vendor W-8BEN review touches money, access, legal exposure, or a vendor commitment, the dependent action waits for the controller. Accounts Payable Manager records the pause reason and the time the issue was raised. The accounts payable specialist routes the question instead of resolving it. That is not delay; it is the control working as designed."
