          "A useful daily check for foreign vendor W-8BEN review starts with the source, not the status field. The accounts payable specialist confirms the signed W-8BEN and date and the treaty claim and tax classification, then records what is still missing. Cases that cannot move are routed with a reason and a due date. Accounts Payable Manager measures foreign payments supported by a current W-8BEN, so the team can see whether the routine is working."
