          "Some foreign vendor W-8BEN review cases must stop rather than proceed. A missing source, two records that disagree, an expired approval, or an unavailable owner are enough to pause the case. Accounts Payable Manager records the stop reason and the owner who can release it. The accounts payable specialist does not guess what the controller would prefer."
