          "The review ends with one decision for foreign vendor W-8BEN review. Fix the source, simplify the field, change the queue, or stop the work until the owner decides. Accounts Payable Manager gives each change an owner and a check date. That is how a foreign vendor W-8BEN review control improves instead of becoming another status meeting."
