          "Accounts Payable Manager keeps the weekly foreign vendor W-8BEN review handoff to one page. The page names the open cases, the foreign payments supported by a current W-8BEN, and the exceptions waiting on the controller. It also names the cases that were closed without a source, so the gap is visible. A short handoff that is actually read beats a long report that nobody opens."
