          "Once a month, pull a small foreign vendor W-8BEN review sample and test the source, the decision, the execution, and the confirmation. Report the sample size and the exceptions, not only a percentage. Accounts Payable Manager includes one difficult case in the sample. The review should show whether the control works when the queue is busy."
